## Code Example

```javascript
// minimal end-to-end tracing snippet
const tracer = require('@opentelemetry/api').trace.getTracer('cnpa-service');
app.get('/register', (req, res) => {
  const span = tracer.startSpan('http_request');
  // propagate context to downstream
  // DB insert and Kafka publish here
  span.end();
  res.end('ok');
});
```

